<title>POLAND: ELPO JULY NET RISES TO PLN 142,400 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELPO JULY NET RISES TO PLN 142,400 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.14 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.20 vs   0.21</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.06 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Sales		    1.61 vs   1.35</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.22 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.70 vs   1.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.49 vs   1.19</p>
<p> Sales		   10.63 vs   8.29</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Przemyslu Odziezowego Elpo SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
